VITE_APP_DESCRIPTION=A comprehensive CRM solution for Dhariya Farms, designed to streamline customer interactions, manage sales and marketing efforts, and enhance overall business efficiency. This application provides tools for tracking customer data, managing orders, and analyzing sales performance, all tailored to meet the unique needs of the agricultural industry. With a user-friendly interface and robust features, Dhariya Farms CRM aims to empower the business to build stronger customer relationships and drive growth.